  "description": "Probes the pair-generator extension of `prop:atomic-braid-mass`'s formula M = constituent + α·Σ ln|V_i| by adding α·z²·Σ_{i<j} ln|V_i V_j|. This term is the log-volume analog of T_3 = -z² Σ Li_2^q(-|V_i V_j|) from `thm:knot-mass-formula-unified`. The naive log-additive implementation Σ ln|V_i V_j| = (n-1)·Σ ln|V_i| is a pure rescaling and does not improve accuracy. The correct pair-gen term requires Wedderburn-block-decomposed pair amplitudes (sym/std/alt coupling), parallel to the full-Wedderburn single-gen volume.",
